<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Haidar Ali Karadiya - Interactive Software Engineer Resume</title>
    
    <!-- External Dependencies: FontAwesome Icons, Google Fonts, and Canvas Confetti -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-deep: #030712;
            --bg-card: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.75);
            --bg-card-hover: rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.85);
            --neon-green: #10b981;
            --neon-cyan: #06b6d4;
            --neon-purple: #8b5cf6;
            --neon-amber: #f59e0b;
            --text-white: #f9fafb;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --border-line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --border-glow: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
            --main-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #06b6d4 50%, #8b5cf6 100%);
            --glow-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
            --transition-speed: 0.3s;
        }

        /* Base Resets */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, .candidate-name, .btn-action, .stat-number, .badge {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        }

        code, pre {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-deep);
            color: var(--text-white);
            line-height: 1.6;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.07) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 50%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.06) 0%, transparent 40%),
                linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 35px 35px, 35px 35px;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* Container Layout */
        .resume-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Action Controls Header (Top Bar) */
        .top-action-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .action-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn-action {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            outline: none;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .btn-back {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            color: var(--text-white);
            border-color: var(--border-line);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
            transform: translateX(-4px);
        }

        .btn-download {
            background: var(--main-gradient);
            color: #030712;
            box-shadow: var(--glow-shadow);
        }

        .btn-download:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45);
        }

        .btn-theme-toggle {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
        }

        .btn-theme-toggle:hover {
            color: var(--neon-amber);
            border-color: var(--neon-amber);
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }

        /* Main Glassmorphic Resume Canvas */
        .resume-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 50px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .resume-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 3px;
            background: var(--main-gradient);
        }

        /* Profile Banner Section */
        .profile-header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            padding-bottom: 35px;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .header-main-info {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 300px;
        }

        .candidate-name {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: var(--main-gradient);
            
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .candidate-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: var(--neon-green);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-green);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.7); }
            70% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); }
            100% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); }
        }

        .contact-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            list-style: none;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
        }

        .contact-item:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05);
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        .contact-item i {
            color: var(--neon-green);
        }

        .contact-item a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Metric Quick Stats */
        .quick-stats-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            min-width: 120px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
        }

        .stat-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-purple);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Generic Section Headers */
        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            color: var(--text-white);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin: 40px 0 22px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-title i {
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--border-line), transparent);
        }

        /* About Box Styling */
        .about-box {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-cyan);
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            position: relative;
        }

        .about-box strong {
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        /* Interactive Filter Bar for Skills */
        .filter-controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .filter-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .filter-btn:hover, .filter-btn.active {
            background: var(--neon-cyan);
            color: #030712;
            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
        }

        /* Skills Matrix */
        .skills-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .skill-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
        }

        .skill-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--border-glow);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            background: var(--bg-card-hover);
        }

        .skill-card-header {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--neon-purple);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .skill-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .tag {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            color: var(--text-white);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Experience Items Styling */
        .timeline-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .experience-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 26px;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .experience-card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
            background: var(--bg-card-hover);
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .exp-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .exp-role {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        .exp-company {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .exp-date {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--neon-green);
            font-weight: 600;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .bullet-points {
            list-style: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        .bullet-points li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 24px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.94rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .bullet-points li::before {
            content: "▹";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .bullet-points li strong {
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        /* Two-Column Grid for Education & Certifications */
        .two-column-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(380px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .edu-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
        }

        .edu-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-purple);
        }

        .edu-degree {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        .edu-school {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--neon-purple);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .edu-score {
            color: var(--neon-green);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Certifications List */
        .cert-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .cert-item {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
        }

        .cert-item:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-amber);
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .cert-icon {
            color: var(--neon-amber);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .cert-details h4 {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        .cert-details p {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Profiles Badges Grid */
        .social-links-grid {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .social-tag {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
            color: var(--text-white);
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 200px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .social-tag:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        /* Print Override Styles */
        @media print {
            body {
                background: #ffffff !important;
                color: #000000 !important;
                padding: 0 !important;
            }

            .top-action-bar, .filter-controls, .btn-theme-toggle {
                display: none !important;
            }

            .resume-card {
                background: #ffffff !important;
                border: none !important;
                box-shadow: none !important;
                padding: 0 !important;
                color: #000000 !important;
            }

            .candidate-name {
                color: #000000 !important;
                -webkit-text-fill-color: #000000 !important;
            }

            .candidate-title, .section-title i, .exp-company, .edu-school {
                color: #2563eb !important;
            }

            .contact-item, .stat-card, .skill-card, .experience-card, .edu-card, .cert-item, .social-tag, .about-box {
                background: #f8fafc !important;
                border: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
                color: #1e293b !important;
            }

            .text-muted, .bullet-points li, .about-box {
                color: #334155 !important;
            }

            .exp-date {
                background: #e0f2fe !important;
                color: #0369a1 !important;
                border: none !important;
            }

            .tag {
                background: #e2e8f0 !important;
                color: #0f172a !important;
                border: none !important;
            }
        }

        /* Responsive Breakpoints */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .resume-card {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }

            .candidate-name {
                font-size: 2.1rem;
            }

            .two-column-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .top-action-bar {
                flex-direction: flex-row;
            }

            .quick-stats-container {
                width: 100%;
                justify-content: space-between;
            }

            .stat-card {
                flex: 1;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="resume-container">
        
        <!-- Top Navigation & Action Controls -->
        <div class="top-action-bar">
            <a href="/" class="btn-action btn-back">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Hub
            </a>

            <div class="action-group">
                

                <!-- Directly Trigger File Download with Confetti Effect -->
                <a href="images/Haidar Ali.pdf" download="Haidar ALi Resume" class="btn-action btn-download" id="downloadBtn">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down"></i> Download Resume PDF
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Structured Resume Document -->
        <main class="resume-card" id="resumeContent">

            <!-- Profile Overview Header -->
            <header class="profile-header">
                <div class="header-main-info">
                    <h1 class="candidate-name">Haidar Ali Karadiya</h1>
                    <div class="candidate-title">
                        <span class="status-dot"></span> Full Stack Software Engineer
                    </div>
                    
                    <ul class="contact-grid">
                        <li class="contact-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
                            <a href="mailto:karadiyahaiderali7@gmail.com">karadiyahaiderali7@gmail.com</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="contact-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>
                            <a href="tel:+918780929056">+91 8780929056</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="contact-item">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i>
                            <span>Vadodara, Gujarat, India</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Strategic Experience Indicators -->
                <div class="quick-stats-container">
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">2+</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Years Experience</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">10+</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Deployed Apps</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">Top 45</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">SIH Finalist</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </header>

            <!-- Professional Summary / About Me -->
            <section>
                <h2 class="section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear"></i> Professional Summary</h2>
                <div class="about-box">
                    I am a <strong>Full-Stack Software Engineer</strong> and <strong>National Hackathon Finalist</strong> specializing in building robust, high-performance web architectures and scalable mobile applications. Possessing hands-on technical proficiency in professional backend roles and freelance software engineering, I bridge clean code design with real-world product scalability.
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Tech Skill Inventory Section -->
            <section>
                <h2 class="section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i> Core Technical Skills</h2>
                
                <div class="filter-controls">
                    <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All Skills</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="languages">Languages</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="frameworks">Frameworks</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="databases">Databases</button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="tools">Tools & DevOps</button>
                </div>

                <div class="skills-wrapper">
                    <div class="skill-card" data-category="languages">
                        <div class="skill-card-header">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> Programming Languages
